WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.614
Video 17. Print, Excel, PDF ane share.

00:00:05.814 --> 00:00:10.179
Darek report ane darek voucher ma e j keys
chhe.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:16.441
Ctrl+P thi print. Ctrl+E thi export, jem ke
Excel ma.

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:23.248
Save as PDF thi PDF file bane chhe. Ctrl+M thi
e-mail.

00:00:23.548 --> 00:00:26.863
Ek report kholo, jem ke Bills Receivable.

00:00:28.141 --> 00:00:35.136
Ctrl+P thi print window khule chhe: printer,
copies, title ane paper.

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:40.610
I thi page no preview dekhaay chhe. Esc thi
paachha.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:49.922
Windows app ma, P thi computer ni print window khule
chhe. Tema pages no preview dekhaay chhe.

00:00:49.852 --> 00:00:58.564
PDF file maate, printer Save as PDF pasand karo.
Pachhi Save dabaavo, ane file nu naam lakho.

00:00:58.865 --> 00:01:07.591
Ctrl+E thi export window khule chhe. Tema
format, folder ane file nu naam dekhaay chhe.

00:01:07.621 --> 00:01:17.868
F8 thi formats ni list: jem ke Excel, PDF ane
CSV. excel type karo, ane Enter dabaavo.

00:01:17.898 --> 00:01:23.472
E thi file export thaay chhe. Aa saachi Excel
file chhe.

00:01:25.108 --> 00:01:32.422
Windows app ma, message bataave chhe ke file
kya chhe: Documents, Hisaab, Exports.

00:01:32.722 --> 00:01:38.542
Day Book maate K dabaavo. Enter thi Sales
invoice 4 khule chhe.

00:01:39.244 --> 00:01:46.837
Ctrl+P thi invoice print ma jevu dekhaay tevu
dekhaay chhe, GST ane QR code saathe.

00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:52.948
Ctrl+M thi e-mail khule chhe. Hisaab subject
ane message bhare chhe.

00:01:52.978 --> 00:02:03.397
Address lakho. Ctrl+A thi tamaaro e-mail program khule
chhe. PDF jodva maate e-mail profile set karo.

00:02:03.877 --> 00:02:09.717
Aagalno video: GSTR-1 ane GSTR-3B.

